{"schema":"hsr-localizations.v1","entryId":"other-npc-p4178","chapterId":"s37952dd86aa46b72","language":"zh-CN","referenceCommit":"74a7b96fba32f00cf495a5c00b0311bd02207aaf","rows":[{"id":"other-npc-p4178-fbe3d2bfcd419743ce18","text":"哟，你哪位？这儿是博物馆修理间，可没展览给你看哪……","speaker":"鲍里斯"},{"id":"other-npc-p4178-172b2f8442a879f99d3d","text":"我是佩拉小姐派来帮忙的。","speaker":""},{"id":"other-npc-p4178-09943d76cbc5ae4ceba3","text":"佩拉小姐派来帮忙的……","speaker":"鲍里斯"},{"id":"other-npc-p4178-8994cff1f465ab825b1f","text":"我是贝洛伯格的大英雄。","speaker":""},{"id":"other-npc-p4178-37c77a04c49fd58882d4","text":"贝洛伯格的大英雄……","speaker":"鲍里斯"},{"id":"other-npc-p4178-5ba35640f18e31951071","text":"[开拓者]……","speaker":"鲍里斯"},{"id":"other-npc-p4178-6ca3cc9ebb54fc943191","text":"哎哟，我想起来了——哈哈，你瞧我这记性！","speaker":"鲍里斯"},{"id":"other-npc-p4178-584faa0319d1022c03fe","text":"幸会幸会，我是博物馆的文物修复员鲍里斯！刚才没能认出来，实在是不好意思啊。","speaker":"鲍里斯"}]}
